### Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime and its installers — Microsoft terms

The Oblireach agent MSI ships Microsoft's Evergreen Bootstrapper for the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime (`MicrosoftEdgeWebview2Setup.exe`), redistributed unmodified and with Microsoft's own signature. When the runtime is missing, the agent service runs it to install the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime for the whole machine; the installation also adds the Microsoft Edge Update services and scheduled tasks that keep the runtime up to date. The bootstrapper, the runtime and Microsoft Edge Update are Microsoft software, licensed under the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime license terms and Microsoft's distribution terms ("Distribute your app and the WebView2 Runtime", https://learn.microsoft.com/microsoft-edge/webview2/concepts/distribution), not under this license.

Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.

